# "Any number of cards": Bot1 chooses none of its five other cards, so none goes to the bottom, none is ordered, and it draws just the one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Valakut Awakening
Island
Plains
Swamp
Mox Sapphire
Island x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Valakut Awakening.Cast
Bot1.Choose()

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Library.Count = 4
